{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"outage","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A Git template without an info directory causes every manual landing to abort when the script writes info/exclude."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"outage","trigger":"unusual","reason":"Repositories with filtered files can be falsely reported as dirty and blocked from landing, though this checkout has no such files."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"test","trigger":"normal","reason":"The test routinely writes its injected configuration to the isolated repository, leaving the intended late clone-configuration case untested."}]}